{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is simple. Walk through the <strong>Red</strong> door, or the <strong>Blue</strong> door. Once on the other side you may find yourself in strange, disturbing, comforting, or even funny places. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892240/extras/f323c3a6f6051196b29d58842baf5fda.poster.avif?t=1769433045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892240/extras/f323c3a6f6051196b29d58842baf5fda.webm?t=1769433045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892240/extras/f323c3a6f6051196b29d58842baf5fda.mp4?t=1769433045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hundred Doors</strong> is a first-person psychological horror experience where you must explore a series of surreal, unsettling rooms\u2014each one stranger, darker, and more twisted than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892240/extras/bcd2f942aec0272fd640184a31a316bd.poster.avif?t=1769433045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892240/extras/bcd2f942aec0272fd640184a31a316bd.webm?t=1769433045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892240/extras/bcd2f942aec0272fd640184a31a316bd.mp4?t=1769433045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With only your wits and limited interaction, you\u2019ll witness deeply disturbing scenes, emotional echoes, and uncanny visions designed to leave you uncomfortable, intrigued, and even guilty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892240/extras/7fe04f819ec9edba9efbcffcdcc326ea.poster.avif?t=1769433045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892240/extras/7fe04f819ec9edba9efbcffcdcc326ea.webm?t=1769433045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892240/extras/7fe04f819ec9edba9efbcffcdcc326ea.mp4?t=1769433045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each door you open takes you deeper. Some lead to quiet moments of reflection or eerie peace. Others spiral into nightmares of guilt, shame, and fear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892240/extras/7d991e947bebc7e5e85dc0a0a256fdc1.poster.avif?t=1769433045\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892240/extras/7d991e947bebc7e5e85dc0a0a256fdc1.webm?t=1769433045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892240/extras/7d991e947bebc7e5e85dc0a0a256fdc1.mp4?t=1769433045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices matter, even when they seem meaningless. Some rooms react to your presence. Some watch you. Others remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892240/extras/b1c2e9a46ad0fba66bc304ec7279dd7c.poster.avif?t=1769433045\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892240/extras/b1c2e9a46ad0fba66bc304ec7279dd7c.webm?t=1769433045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892240/extras/b1c2e9a46ad0fba66bc304ec7279dd7c.mp4?t=1769433045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no combat. There is no escape.<br>Just a simple question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you make it through all one hundred doors?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Second Chance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892240/5f1c07d2a65326ffae1d79f114f1ab56f0f38339.jpg"},{"name":"Look Both Ways","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892240/abe729a905ade933785ad03ade4965986d48d115.jpg"},{"name":"Stinky Stinky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892240/cbabd43621018e21446202a2d6c47ce0feb4ee67.jpg"},{"name":"Into the Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892240/b3b769d3efbb297885bae3bdd86b2e911972f958.jpg"},{"name":"Suffer No More","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892240/aca15d28ac60124b642b3996aff10713c4f526f8.jpg"},{"name":"Lost Forever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892240/d662181b0a9049245db8ab0ca7748df7d055d5f5.jpg"},{"name":"Halfway Back","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892240/3e43afa0afdf2eee850a638eaf7f9c388af88588.jpg"},{"name":"Itchy Tasty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892240/74e2d38fde5f4fd03983564fa8ee2df7306e9157.jpg"},{"name":"I Plead the Fifth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/st